WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 4.9 · People, Culture & Volunteers
Offboarding, handover and continuity

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
People will leave, one day even you: plan exits and handovers before anyone goes.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Remove system and bank access on the last day.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Keep a short handover note for each key role.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Plan who could step into the founder's role.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You draft an offboarding checklist and a succession note.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
